    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 6 Publish\nSends the editor the video in Slack with Approve and Reject, and waits up to 3 hours. Approve posts it to the outlet channel and drafts the newsletter blurb. Reject sends a short note.\n\nCredential: Slack. Channels come from `SLACK_CHANNELS` in the pipeline's build.mjs.\n\nIts test webhook needs a run with a real `video_url`, such as 5 Render's output.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
